WEBVTT

00:00:01.644 --> 00:00:04.898
Somewhere out there is something you would love doing.

00:00:05.368 --> 00:00:06.846
You just haven't met it yet.

00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:12.820
Most of us never get past… I should try that.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.902
Not for lack of curiosity.

00:00:14.902 --> 00:00:16.513
For lack of a way in.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:21.148
So follow your curiosity.

00:00:21.148 --> 00:00:22.982
This is Aspect Niche.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:30.340
Tell it what pulls at you, and a living map unfolds.

00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:36.439
Forty-seven hobbies, linked by what they have in common.

00:00:39.217 --> 00:00:41.451
Tap one to see what it really takes:

00:00:41.451 --> 00:00:45.026
where it happens, how often, how hard it is to start,

00:00:45.026 --> 00:00:46.281
and what it costs.

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:50.761
And if it hooks you, go further.

00:00:50.761 --> 00:00:53.053
Every hobby has its own rabbit hole.

00:00:55.883 --> 00:00:57.937
Keep the ones that speak to you.

00:00:57.937 --> 00:01:00.434
Together, they become your constellation.

00:01:03.117 --> 00:01:06.680
Browse every one of them… or let it surprise you.

00:01:09.217 --> 00:01:13.605
Give a new idea room to grow, on a board that is all yours.

00:01:15.883 --> 00:01:18.265
Then turn someday into a plan.

00:01:18.265 --> 00:01:22.049
Pick a time, pick a place, and it's waiting in Plans.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.943
Better yet, bring someone.

00:01:25.943 --> 00:01:29.181
An invitation is just a link, and it opens for anyone,

00:01:29.181 --> 00:01:30.130
app or not.

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:33.879
Planning a date?

00:01:33.879 --> 00:01:37.784
Offer a few ideas, then pass the phone, and decide together.

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:44.422
Every photo and every note stays with the hobby it belongs to,

00:01:44.422 --> 00:01:47.200
so you can walk back through how far you've come.

00:01:49.167 --> 00:01:53.323
Pick the icons every hobby is drawn in, from six different sets.

00:01:55.883 --> 00:01:57.728
Earn milestones as you go,

00:01:57.728 --> 00:02:00.082
and make the whole map feel like yours.

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:07.676
Your next favorite thing is closer than you think.

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:13.982
Aspect Niche.

00:02:13.982 --> 00:02:15.633
Follow your curiosity.
